WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions for the narration on welock-draft-vo.mp4 (the modal cut). They are not
offered as `default`: the film's title cards are burned into the picture, so
forcing these on would print a second line of text over them.

The cue times are the script's target timeline, not a transcript of one export
-- scripts/build-vo.sh pins the read to that same timeline and reports any line
that lands more than 0.3s off it. If a line is retimed there, retime it here.
Source of truth for both: VOICEOVER.md.

The ambient thumbnail in the hero points at this file too, but it is muted and
aria-hidden, so these cues are never rendered there.

line-1
